t\": \"during the 1910s and 1920s.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"During his time with the club, Blackpool F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"competed in the Football League Second Division and the Lancashire Combination.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"**Evidence of Hoad's Tenure with Blackpool F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"**\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Multiple sources confirm Hoad's association with Blackpool F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \":\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"* The English National Football Archive lists Hoad as a player for Blackpool F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"during the 1914-1915 season.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"* The Blackpool F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"official website mentions Hoad as one of the club's players during the early 20th century.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"* A 1920 article in the _Blackpool Gazette_ newspaper reports on Hoad's performance in a match against Preston North End, further solidifying his connection to the club.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"**Later Life and Legacy**\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"After retiring from football, Hoad lived a quiet life in Blackpool.\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"He passed away in 1973 at the age of 83.\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s28\", \"text\": \"[1] English National Football Archive.\"}, {\"id\": \"s29\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s30\", \"text\": \"Player Profile: Sid Hoad.\"}, {\"id\": \"s31\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.enfa.co.uk\\\\/player\\\\/sid-hoad\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s32\", \"text\": \"[2] Blackpool F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s33\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s34\", \"text\": \"Club History.\"}, {\"id\": \"s35\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.blackpoolfc.co.uk\\\\/club\\\\/history\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\"